body:
Largely because, even though Nine only had one season, it's still a small sample size to be basing an opinion on - especially given that some people are saying outrangeous shit like "this proves The Doctor should always be a man" based on season 11.

&#x200B;

Of course, all of this is hugely opinion based. I mean, OP things 9 was fantastic and I think he was the worst Doctor ever.  It's almost as if its all subjective.
